<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>BADDIE VAULT — Essential Fashion Guide & Wardrobe</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700;800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0a0a0c;
            --card-bg: #141419;
            --accent-pink: #ff2a6d;
            --accent-purple: #9b51e0;
            --accent-gold: #f2c94c;
            --text-main: #f0f0f5;
            --text-muted: #8e8e93;
            --border-color: #24242d;
            --gradient-primary: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff2a6d 0%, #9b51e0 100%);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Header / Hero */
        header {
            padding: 60px 20px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at top center, rgba(255, 42, 109, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            background: rgba(255, 42, 109, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--accent-pink);
            color: var(--accent-pink);
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            background: var(--gradient-primary);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p.subtitle {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 30px;
        }

        /* Stats / Quick Info Bar */
        .info-bar {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .info-item {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .info-item .num {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }

        .info-item .label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Navigation / Categories */
        .category-nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            background: rgba(10, 10, 12, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            z-index: 100;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        }

        .nav-btn {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-main);
            padding: 10px 22px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover, .nav-btn.active {
            background: var(--gradient-primary);
            border-color: transparent;
            color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(255, 42, 109, 0.3);
        }

        /* Main Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .section-title::after {
            content: '';
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: var(--border-color);
        }

        /* Catalog Grid */
        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 16px;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
            position: relative;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
            border-color: rgba(255, 42, 109, 0.5);
        }

        .card-img-wrapper {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 340px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card-img-wrapper img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
            transition: transform 0.5s ease;
        }

        .card:hover .card-img-wrapper img {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .tag-style {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            left: 15px;
            background: rgba(10, 10, 12, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .card-desc {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .style-tips {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-pink);
            padding: 10px 12px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #d0d0db;
        }

        .style-tips strong {
            color: var(--accent-pink);
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Checklist Section */
        .essentials-box {
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #181822 0%, #101017 100%);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .checklist-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .check-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .check-icon {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            background: var(--gradient-primary);
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 800;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        /* Rules / Vibe Section */
        .vibe-section {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .vibe-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .vibe-number {
            font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            background: var(--gradient-primary);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .vibe-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .vibe-card p {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        footer span {
            color: var(--accent-pink);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Header Section -->
    <header>
        <div class="badge">Aesthetic Style Guide</div>
        <h1>Baddie Vault</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">O guia definitivo de vestuário, outfits e essenciais para dominar a estética Baddie com atitude, elegância e poder.</p>
        
        <div class="info-bar">
            <div class="info-item">
                <div class="num">04</div>
                <div class="label">Estilos Core</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-item">
                <div class="num">12+</div>
                <div class="label">Peças Chave</div>
            </div>
            <div class="info-item">
                <div class="num">100%</div>
                <div class="label">Attitude & Confidence</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Navigation Filters -->
    <nav class="category-nav">
        <button class="nav-btn active">Todos os Styles</button>
        <button class="nav-btn">Streetwear Baddie</button>
        <button class="nav-btn">Glam Baddie</button>
        <button class="nav-btn">Y2K Baddie</button>
        <button class="nav-btn">Cozy & Athleisure</button>
    </nav>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="container">

        <!-- Wardrobe Catalog -->
        <h2 class="section-title">Lookbook & Outfits Essenciais</h2>
        
        <div class="grid">
            
            <!-- Item 1 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                    <span class="tag-style">Streetwear</span>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1515886657613-9f3515b0c78f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Streetwear Baddie Fit">
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Oversized Leather & Cargo</h3>
                    <p class="card-desc">Jaqueta de cabedal oversized contrastada com calças cargo baggy e top justo estruturado.</p>
                    <div class="style-tips">
                        <strong>Styling Tip</strong>
                        Combina com sapatilhas de sola grossa (chunky sneakers) e óculos de sol ovais pretos.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 2 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                    <span class="tag-style">Glam Baddie</span>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1539109136881-3be0616acf4b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Glam Baddie Dress">
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Bodycon Corset Dress</h3>
                    <p class="card-desc">Vestido justo modelador estilo corset em tons neutros (nude, preto ou castanho chocolate).</p>
                    <div class="style-tips">
                        <strong>Styling Tip</strong>
                        Eleva o look com saltos transparentes de tiras e brincos argola grandes em dourado.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 3 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                    <span class="tag-style">Y2K Baddie</span>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1509631179647-0177331693ae?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Y2K Denim Fit">
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Denim-on-Denim & Baby Tee</h3>
                    <p class="card-desc">Ganga de cintura baixa relaxada com crop top/baby tee gráfico e cinto de fivela marcante.</p>
                    <div class="style-tips">
                        <strong>Styling Tip</strong>
                        Adiciona uma mala baguete de ombro e maquilhagem com lip gloss brilhante.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 4 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                    <span class="tag-style">Athleisure</span>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518310383802-640c2de311b2?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Baddie Athleisure">
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Biker Set & Puffer Jacket</h3>
                    <p class="card-desc">Conjunto monocromático de top desportivo e calções biker com blusão puffer oversized.</p>
                    <div class="style-tips">
                        <strong>Styling Tip</strong>
                        Meias brancas subidas, sapatilhas de corrida estilo retro e boné de pala curva.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 5 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                    <span class="tag-style">Streetwear</span>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529139574466-a303027c1d8b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Graphic Hoodie Fit">
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Graphic Hoodie & Thigh Highs</h3>
                    <p class="card-desc">Sweatshirt oversized gráfica usada como vestido com botas acima do joelho.</p>
                    <div class="style-tips">
                        <strong>Styling Tip</strong>
                        Equilíbrio perfeito entre o conforto e o glamour sedutor urbano.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Item 6 -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-img-wrapper">
                    <span class="tag-style">Glam Baddie</span>
                    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1566174053879-31528523f8ae?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80" alt="Satin & Leather Look">
                </div>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Satin Top & Leather Trousers</h3>
                    <p class="card-desc">Top acetinado de alças finas combinado com calças de pele sintética de corte direito.</p>
                    <div class="style-tips">
                        <strong>Styling Tip</strong>
                        Adiciona um blazer estruturado nos ombros para um toque "Boss Baddie".
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Baddie Essentials Checklist -->
        <section class="essentials-box">
            <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Checklist: Armário Cápsula Baddie</h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem;">As 8 peças e acessórios indispensáveis que constroem qualquer outfit do estilo:</p>
            
            <div class="checklist-grid">
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Jaqueta de Couro Oversized</div>
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Calças Cargo Baggy</div>
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Tops Corset & Bodysuits</div>
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Brincos de Argola Dourados</div>
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Óculos de Sol Shield / Ovais</div>
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Chunky Sneakers (Sola Alta)</div>
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Mala de Ombro (Baguette Bag)</div>
                <div class="check-item"><div class="check-icon">✓</div> Conjuntos Monocromáticos</div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- The Baddie Rules -->
        <h2 class="section-title">Regras do Estilo & Beauty</h2>
        <div class="vibe-section">
            <div class="vibe-card">
                <div class="vibe-number">01</div>
                <h3>Contraste de Silhueta</h3>
                <p>A regra de ouro: se a peça de baixo for oversized (cargo/joggers), a peça de cima deve ser justa (crop top/corset) e vice-versa.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="vibe-card">
                <div class="vibe-number">02</div>
                <h3>Sobrancelhas & Gloss</h3>
                <p>A maquilhagem é essencial: sobrancelhas bem definidas, contorno de lábios num tom mais escuro com bastante gloss e iluminação estratégica.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="vibe-card">
                <div class="vibe-number">03</div>
                <h3>Acessórios Marcantes</h3>
                <p>Nunca saias sem acessórios: camadas de colares, unhas acrílicas compridas e trabalhadas, e óculos futuristas ou escuros.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>Desenvolvido com <span>✦ Baddie Aesthetic ✦</span> — Todos os direitos reservados.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
